0.122 0.165 0.267 rg BT /F2 10.2 Tf 34.02 447.87 Td (The rub test) Tj ET
0.604 0.631 0.678 rg BT /F1 7.94 Tf 34.02 428.03 Td (1. Paint the patch and let it dry until it is no longer shiny.) Tj ET
0.604 0.631 0.678 rg BT /F1 7.94 Tf 34.02 412.44 Td (2. Set it \(or not\), as the row says. Wait 10 minutes.) Tj ET
0.604 0.631 0.678 rg BT /F1 7.94 Tf 34.02 396.85 Td (3. Press a clean tissue on the patch for 3 seconds. Look at the tissue.) Tj ET
0.604 0.631 0.678 rg BT /F1 7.94 Tf 34.02 381.26 Td (4. Rub the patch gently with a fingertip, 5 times. Look at the edges.) Tj ET
0.604 0.631 0.678 rg BT /F1 7.94 Tf 34.02 365.67 Td (5. Optional: blow warm breath on it or hold a damp cloth near it for a minute, then repeat.) Tj ET
